// Resolve the two modules in this repository against each other from the
// working tree, so that compat/libucl builds here without its pinned version
// of the main module having been published yet.
//
// A workspace file is ignored when either module is consumed as a dependency,
// so this affects development in this repository only.
//
// Building, testing, vetting and `go doc` all work offline against the
// working tree. Commands that load the whole module graph, `go list -m all`
// among them, still try to resolve the pinned version and will fail until the
// main module has been pushed and tagged. That resolves itself on the first
// push; nothing needs changing here when it does.
go 1.23

use (
	.
	./compat/libucl
)
